<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="d13aAjan810" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Working with Fields</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Chris Castro</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Oct 10, 2016"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Contracts Mac May 2017 User Guide</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>The <b>Fields</b> section of the Document Panel lists all smart fields in the agreement document.</p>
      <p>Use the Document Panel to take the following actions on fields in the document:</p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_view_and_change_fields.dita#WorkingwithFields_viewchange" format="dita"
               >View and/or change values for all occurrences of a field.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_reject_changes_to_a_field.dita#WorkingwithFields_rejectchange"
               format="dita">View and/or reject changed field values.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_validate_fields.dita#WorkingwithFields_validatefields">Validate field values.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_mark_fields_for_deletion.dita#WorkingwithFields_deletefields"
               format="dita">Mark fields for deletion.</xref>
         </li>
      </ul>
   </conbody>
</concept>